senses.gloss:
रुदित, अस्, आ, अम्, wept, lamented, deplored;
weeping, crying, lamenting; wet with tears; (अम्),
n. a weeping, wailing, crying, lamentation.

रुद्रिय, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. belonging or relating
to Rudra [cf. शत-रुद्रिय], coming from Rudra;
relating to the Rudras, coming from them, &c.;
terrific, fearful, awful, impetuous; (according to Sāy.
also) uttering praise or giving pleasure; (आस्), m. pl.
the Maruts; (अम्), n. Rudra's majesty or power;
(Sāy.) pleasure, delight (= सुख).
